      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_system_01",
      "hash64": "8E0B5A368673287A",
      "text": "大約１年多前……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_kakutouboss_01",
      "hash64": "8A4BA32B26466294",
      "text": "對不起……\\n我是不是做過頭了……[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_akuboss_01",
      "hash64": "A36B9964C593B189",
      "text": "別在意。[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_akuboss_02",
      "hash64": "A36B9664C593AC70",
      "text": "拜託妳用實戰的方式\\n來訓練的是我們啊。[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_kakutouboss_02",
      "hash64": "8A4BA62B264667AD",
      "text": "可是……[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_dokuboss_01",
      "hash64": "C6B00BA0BF825A19",
      "text": "閣下不需謝罪。[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_dokuboss_02",
      "hash64": "C6B008A0BF825500",
      "text": "託枇琶閣下的特訓的福，\\n在下正朝登峰造極之路直奔。[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_fairyboss_01",
      "hash64": "15A231192EB8F00F",
      "text": "要是沒有枇琶妳的話，\\n我的寶可夢也沒辦法進化了。[VAR 0x0114(0020)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0020"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_honooboss_01",
      "hash64": "33700B5D07EC0C89",
      "text": "真老大也說過還好有枇琶姐在，\\n我們才有辦法對抗霸凌別人的學生。[VAR 0x0114(001F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_akuboss_03",
      "hash64": "A36B9764C593AE23",
      "text": "真的超感謝的唷。\\n枇琶是天星隊的榜樣！[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_kakutouboss_03",
      "hash64": "8A4BA52B264665FA",
      "text": "呵呵，\\n才沒有那回事……！[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_fairyboss_02",
      "hash64": "15A232192EB8F1C2",
      "text": "不過啊，都練習４個小時了，\\n我差不多要到極限了……[VAR 0x0114(0020)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0020"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_kakutouboss_04",
      "hash64": "8A4BA02B26465D7B",
      "text": "啊，對不起！\\n那麼，大家休息一下！[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_kakutouboss_05",
      "hash64": "8A4B9F2B26465BC8",
      "text": "我去跑跑步！[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_dokuboss_03",
      "hash64": "C6B009A0BF8256B3",
      "text": "在下和大家都是輪流做訓練，\\n但枇琶閣下妳總是在指導別人……\\r\\n在下擔心妳的身體會吃不消。[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_kakutouboss_06",
      "hash64": "8A4BA22B264660E1",
      "text": "秋明，謝謝你。[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_kakutouboss_07",
      "hash64": "8A4BA12B26465F2E",
      "text": "最近呀，不管我有多累有多想哭，\\n都能撐過去。[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_kakutouboss_08",
      "hash64": "8A4B9C2B264656AF",
      "text": "我們不是模仿道館徽章，\\n一起做了天星隊的徽章嗎？[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_kakutouboss_21",
      "hash64": "8A45172B26410902",
      "text": "我只要看到那個徽章，\\n力量就會不斷湧上……\\r\\n我就能打起幹勁加油！[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_kakutouboss_09",
      "hash64": "8A4B9B2B264654FC",
      "text": "雖然我……加油了……\\n但……還是失敗了……[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_kakutouboss_10",
      "hash64": "8A481E2B26434ABE",
      "text": "[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳很強。\\n雖然隊規本就這麼規定，\\r\\n但我自己也希望[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳擁有它。[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
