      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_kakutouboss_12",
      "hash64": "8A481C2B26434758",
      "text": "參加星塵大作戰的[VAR 0x0100(0000)]。[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_kakutouboss_13",
      "hash64": "8A481D2B2643490B",
      "text": "和[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳對戰之後我明白了。\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳不是一個討人厭的傢伙。[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 1,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_kakutouboss_14",
      "hash64": "8A48222B2643518A",
      "text": "從[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳的寶可夢們看著[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳的眼神，\\n我明白了這一點。[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 1,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_kakutouboss_15",
      "hash64": "8A48232B2643533D",
      "text": "不過，能拜託[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳把視線稍微挪開一下嗎？\\n現在我有點難過……[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_kakutouboss_16",
      "hash64": "8A48202B26434E24",
      "text": "……唔唔。[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 5,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_kakutouboss_17",
      "hash64": "8A48212B26434FD7",
      "text": "唔啊啊啊啊～～～！！！[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
