    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_sitappa_03",
      "hash64": "E7EEF1AC2C216F2B",
      "text": "……有話想問我？[VAR 0x0114(003F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_nelke_08",
      "hash64": "5C185D40FEE607D5",
      "text": "和其他手下相比，\\n妳對待老大的方式不太一樣。[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_nelke_09",
      "hash64": "5C185C40FEE60622",
      "text": "可以告訴我理由嗎？[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 45,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_sitappa_04",
      "hash64": "E7EEF6AC2C2177AA",
      "text": "你的觀察力真好。\\n……好吧，我告訴你。[VAR 0x0114(003F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 46,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_sitappa_05",
      "hash64": "E7EEF7AC2C21795D",
      "text": "我以前看枇琶很不順眼。[VAR 0x0114(003F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 47,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_nelke_10",
      "hash64": "5C14DF40FEE2FBE4",
      "text": "[EMPTY 68]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BDFF",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 48,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_sitappa_06",
      "hash64": "E7EEF4AC2C217444",
      "text": "[EMPTY 68]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BDFF",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 49,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_sitappa_07",
      "hash64": "E7EEF5AC2C2175F7",
      "text": "她長得漂亮，運動全能，\\n還是個優秀的訓練家。[VAR 0x0114(003F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 50,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_sitappa_08",
      "hash64": "E7EEEAAC2C216346",
      "text": "枇琶在入學之後，\\n立刻就成了學院的人氣寵兒。[VAR 0x0114(003F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 51,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_sitappa_09",
      "hash64": "E7EEEBAC2C2164F9",
      "text": "超越了在那之前\\n最受大家喜愛的我……[VAR 0x0114(003F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 52,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_nelke_11",
      "hash64": "5C14E040FEE2FD97",
      "text": "所以，妳開始找她麻煩……？[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 53,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_sitappa_10",
      "hash64": "E7F278AC2C248A67",
      "text": "是的。\\n我號召同學們做了很多有的沒有的……\\r\\n當時的我真是太愚蠢了。[VAR 0x0114(003F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 54,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_sitappa_11",
      "hash64": "E7F277AC2C2488B4",
      "text": "[EMPTY 68]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BDFF",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 55,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_nelke_12",
      "hash64": "5C14E140FEE2FF4A",
      "text": "[EMPTY 68]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BDFF",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 56,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_sitappa_12",
      "hash64": "E7F27AAC2C248DCD",
      "text": "但是，那終究只是小孩子的遊戲。\\n玩膩了，就開始想要尋找別的刺激。[VAR 0x0114(003F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 57,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_sitappa_13",
      "hash64": "E7F279AC2C248C1A",
      "text": "於是很快地班上下一個\\n霸凌的對象就變成了我。[VAR 0x0114(003F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 58,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_nelke_13",
      "hash64": "5C14E240FEE300FD",
      "text": "[EMPTY 68]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BDFF",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 59,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_sitappa_14",
      "hash64": "E7F274AC2C24839B",
      "text": "……這就是因果報應吧。\\n但是，枇琶她向這麼愚蠢的我\\r\\n伸出了援手。[VAR 0x0114(003F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 60,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_sitappa_15",
      "hash64": "E7F273AC2C2481E8",
      "text": "「沒有容身之地，很痛苦吧？」\\n她這麼跟我說，然後邀我加入天星隊。[VAR 0x0114(003F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 61,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_nelke_14",
      "hash64": "5C14DB40FEE2F518",
      "text": "邀請曾經霸凌自己的罪魁禍首……\\n她真的是一個了不起的女性。[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 62,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_sitappa_16",
      "hash64": "E7F276AC2C248701",
      "text": "……她真的很了不起。\\n我加入天星隊之後，一直過得很開心。[VAR 0x0114(003F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 63,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_nelke_15",
      "hash64": "5C14DC40FEE2F6CB",
      "text": "但也有天星隊在霸凌別人的傳聞……[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 64,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_sitappa_17",
      "hash64": "E7F275AC2C24854E",
      "text": "你聽完剛剛的那些話，\\n還會那麼想嗎？[VAR 0x0114(003F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 65,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_nelke_16",
      "hash64": "5C14DD40FEE2F87E",
      "text": "不，這個嘛……[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 66,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_sitappa_18",
      "hash64": "E7F270AC2C247CCF",
      "text": "能有現在的我，\\n都是託枇琶和天星隊的福。[VAR 0x0114(003F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 67,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_sitappa_19",
      "hash64": "E7F26FAC2C247B1C",
      "text": "不要奪走……\\n我們重要的寶物。[VAR 0x0114(003F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
